{
  "bookId": "rewind-25",
  "id": "chapter-98",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "24000001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "「咯吱，咯吱」，魔王的脚步声近了。\n小女孩蜷在衣柜里，绝望地等待厄运降临。一秒，两秒......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "好安静，难道这次逃过一劫？\n她鼓足勇气将柜门推开一条缝，忽然，一双冰冷的手攀上她的脖颈......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "找到你了，小朋友——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "呜哇啊啊啊——！！！走、走开！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "哈莉，你这样吓优纪，她会做噩梦的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "切~优纪又不是小孩子。\n就算真有魔王，也不会比天启那群人更欠揍。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好了，和江，继续讲《月之森》后面的故事吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "魔王念起咒语，女孩痛苦地蜷缩身体，发出「呜呜」的呻吟。\n头上长角，脊背伸直，她被变成了一只麋鹿。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000009",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "「呜呜呜，呜呜......」",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嘘——你们听，真的有痛苦的呻吟声！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "是从窗户外面传来的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "24000013",
              "text": "我去看看。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "24000012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "呜呜呜！呜呜！（笨蛋姐妹，快放开本王！）",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "屡教不改的绑架犯，你把樱藏到哪里去了，快说！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "姐姐，她的嘴还被堵着......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "噗哈！笨蛋姐妹，本王什么都不知道！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "24000018",
              "text": "怎么回事？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "24000017",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "樱不见了，我们当然要找她算账。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "奇怪......以莉可的性格，如果真的做了，应该会得意地承认吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "为什么你们认为，是莉可绑架了樱？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "类似的事情哪次不是她做的，惯犯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本里恵",
          "text": "还有一张......樱留下的字条，在这里。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "宫本尤娜",
          "text": "没错！字条上有涂鸦——穿紫色披风，头上长犄角，绝对是坏蛋魔王！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉可",
          "text": "画得好丑！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不，等等，这涂鸦怎么看都像是......阿尔弗雷德？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "管理局的皮衣墨镜大叔？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这么一说我也觉得，那不是犄角，而是造型奇特的黑超吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "24000028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "哈莉",
          "text": "啊哈~事情变得有趣起来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-542",
